'''Marcus Vinícius Dias''' (22 January 1923 – 1992), also commonly known as '''Marcus Vinícius''', was a Brazilian Olympic [[basketball]] player.

Dias was born in [[Rio de Janeiro]], and competed in the [[1948 Summer Olympics]]. There he won the bronze medal with the [[Brazil national basketball team|Brazilian basketball team]] under the guidance of head coach [[Moacyr Daiuto]].<ref name="SportsRef">{{cite Sports-Reference |url=https://www.sports-reference.com/olympics/athletes/di/marcus-vinicius-dias-1.html |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161203030547/https://www.sports-reference.com/olympics/athletes/di/marcus-vinicius-dias-1.html |url-status=dead |archive-date=3 December 2016 |title=Marcus Vinícius Dias |access-date=10 June 2018}}</ref>

